WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.200
A customer writes to you. The email lands in the shared inbox.

2
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:11.900
The agent reads it, and finds the customer and the order in your own system.

3
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:18.267
A draft reply is ready. In your tone, with the right details.

4
00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:22.833
Nothing is sent until a person has approved it.

5
00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:30.067
That is what we set up. In your systems, at a price agreed in advance.
